# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: SailorArc | Scene: TheOldRoad5

translate pt strings:

    old "A few days had passed since they had managed to get past the river crossing."
    new "Passaram-se alguns dias desde que conseguiram ultrapassar a travessia do rio."

    old "A few lights coming from lit lanterns could be seen, shining through the darkness."
    new "Algumas luzes provenientes de lanternas acesas podiam ser vistas, brilhando através da escuridão."

    old "A pain she desired, and a pleasure that harmed her."
    new "Uma dor que ela desejava, e um prazer que a feria."

    old "Mention the dark fountain"
    new "Menciona a fonte escura"

    old "A dark fountain?"
    new "Uma fonte escura?"

    old "Don't confide in Sigmund"
    new "Não confie em Sigmund"

    old "A chance. That's all she had ever wanted."
    new "Uma chance. Isso era tudo o que ela sempre quisera."
